---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy"
  description="Plain-language privacy information for The Buying Desk pilot."
>
  <div class="desk-page desk-prose">
    <header class="desk-page-header">
      <p class="desk-eyebrow">Pilot policy / plain language</p>
      <h1>Privacy without theatre.</h1>
      <p>
        Here's the current pilot in plain English. A lawyer hasnt polished this
        page.
      </p>
    </header>

    <p class="pilot-note">
      <strong>The short version:</strong> this site has no accounts, tracking, cookies,
      payment form, or upload service. The request page builds an email draft on
      your device. It doesnt send anything.
    </p>

    <section>
      <h2>What this site handles</h2>
      <p>
        Your answers stay in this browser tab while it builds the draft. The
        site doesnt post them anywhere. Close or refresh the page and theyre
        gone.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>What email handles</h2>
      <p>
        If you send it, your email provider and mine handle the message and any
        attachments. Your email address comes with it. Dont send passwords,
        payment card numbers, identity documents, or anything I dont need.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Screenshots and listings</h2>
      <p>
        You can attach screenshots in your email app after the draft opens.
        Strip out personal stuff you dont want me to see. Listing links follow
        the seller platform's own privacy rules.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Retention and deletion</h2>
      <p>
        I may keep request emails and reports while I finish the job and answer
        follow-up questions. You can email <a
          href="mailto:amasud.tech@gmail.com">amasud.tech@gmail.com</a
        >
        to ask for deletion. I may need to keep records for an active payment dispute
        or legal requirement.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>
        If I add accounts, payments, analytics, or uploads later, I'll update
        this page first.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
